  triage:title "al5_uds_is_a_framework_adapter_over_the_one_client_and_router fails on integrate/phase-al base (stale test assertion)" ;
  triage:description "The boundary_enforcement test asserts combined.contains(\"PrivateStagingDirectory::create(parent)\"), but crates/atm-http-runtime/src/private_staging.rs exposes a free function private_staging::allocate(parent, \"uds\", ...) instead of a PrivateStagingDirectory type. A prior refactor renamed/replaced the staging allocator without updating this test assertion. Independently reproduced by team-lead and quality-mgr on integrate/phase-al HEAD 4fda46f9 in a clean detached worktree via 'cargo test -p atm-architecture --test boundary_enforcement al5_uds_is_a_framework_adapter_over_the_one_client_and_router', with zero PR #820 changes applied. Confirmed PR #820's diff touches zero files under crates/atm-http-runtime/ or crates/atm-architecture/, so it is not the cause. Fix must update the test assertion to match the current private_staging::allocate API, not revert or rename production code back to a PrivateStagingDirectory type." ;
